  "description": "How can one ever be satisfied with just one? That's Haru's life motto. As usual, he lures a younger guy who enters his strike zone and devours him whole. Not bad for a hetero guy being his first~ he thinks for a split second, Did this guy just eat me up??!! \n\nThe more he thinks about it, the more infuriating it gets—that big-dicked, handsome, cute, infuriating bastard! He happens to run into him again in a college liberal arts class, but this time he claims not to know him... His speech and behavior are completely different. Is this some kind of concept thing...?\n\nWhat...? He's a twin...? That's a lie, right...?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
